Rather than the above changes, we can probably just modify this part as
```python
    @property
    def value(self):
        x = self.widget.get().replace(',', '.')
        x = ase.gui.utils.parse_input_arithmetic(x)
        if '.' in str(x):
            return float(x)
        if x == 'None':
            return None
        return int(x)
```
Then, the arithmetic will hopefully available for all spinboxes, when their `value`s are accessed.
